       "html": "<math display=\"block\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>r</mi><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">cos</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo></mrow><mi>θ</mi><mo>,</mo><mspace width=\"1.0em\"></mspace><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>r</mi><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo></mrow><mi>θ</mi><mo>;</mo><mspace width=\"1.0em\"></mspace><msup><mi>r</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>→</mo><mi>r</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mrow><mspace width=\"0.333em\"></mspace><mtext mathvariant=\"normal\"> (edo </mtext><mspace width=\"0.333em\"></mspace></mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mrow><mtext mathvariant=\"normal\">) </mtext><mspace width=\"0.333em\"></mspace></mrow></mrow></math> <math display=\"block\"><mrow><msup><mi>r</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>r</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">cos</mi><mi>θ</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi><mi>θ</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>→</mo><mi>r</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">cos</mi><mi>θ</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi><mi>θ</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></math> <math display=\"block\"><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mrow><mspace width=\"0.333em\"></mspace><mtext mathvariant=\"normal\"> denean: </mtext><mspace width=\"0.333em\"></mspace></mrow><mspace width=\"1.0em\"></mspace><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">cos</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo></mrow><mi>θ</mi><mo>+</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo></mrow><mi>θ</mi></mrow></math>"
